    {
      "name": "olx_search_listings",
      "description": "GET /search: full-text search across public OLX listings, with category, price, location and condition filters. Returns {data, meta:{total, last_page, current_page, per_page}}. Each result is summarised down to the fields that identify it; use olx_get_listing for the detail of one result.\n\nNote: this endpoint is not part of the official OLX API reference (it is the one the OLX website itself uses) and needs no authentication, so it may change without notice. Every other tool in this server maps to a documented endpoint.",
